DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261015T110000
UID:9de7b6c679465b62dffaa56f74fec2c5@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, October 15 th 11 am: What`s Under That Rock- (Hike)
  Animals like to hide in interesting places. Join Naturalist Kaitlyn on a 
 hike down to the waterfall to see these hidden worlds. This hike includes 
 stairs and slippery rocks so please wear appropriate shoes. Meet at the Ca
 nyon Inn Lawn.
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Canyon Inn\, 250 McCormick's Creek
  Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
