DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261030T160000
UID:807204dab4eb08db268f5139a38bd163@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Friday\, October 30 th 4 pm: Maple Leaf Bat- (Craft) Stop in t
 he Nature Center to turn a maple leaf into a bat in this quick and sustain
 able craft. &nbsp\;
