UID:5ce763a2c89d511666936bf6b5958dea@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, November 7 th 2 pm: Trees to Seeds- (Presentation) 
 Come learn from Indiana Master Gardener and Morgan County Invasive Special
 ist\, David Mow\, on how to grow trees from seeds. Learn the process of st
 ratification and whether it&rsquo\;s needed for the species you would like
  to grow. This presentation is being offered in the Nature Center Auditori
 um. Participants will receive free tree seeds.
